Hi {!Case.Contact},

Thank you for reaching out to EverQuote. I'd be happy to show you how to add text notifications to your EverQuote campaign. By entering the appropriate email address into the CC Addresses field on your campaign, you can receive a text when a lead is delivered to you.

Here are the codes for various carriers:

• AT&T: 10-digit number@txt.att.net

• Boost Mobile: 10-digit number@myboostmobile.com

• Sprint: 10-digit number@messaging.sprintpcs.com

• T-Mobile: 10-digit number@tmomail.net

• Tracfone: 10-digit number@mmst5.tracfone.com

• Verizon: 10-digit number@vtext.com

• Virgin Mobile: 10-digit number@vmobl.com

The first 160 characters of the email will be delivered to your phone. 

As an example, if your number is “123-456-7890” and your carrier was Verizon, you would add “1234567890@vtext.com” to the CC field for email delivery.

Please let me know if you have any questions.

Best Regards,